    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels so heavy. like the silence is actually heavy. i look around and everything is just... meaningless? like i’m just waiting for something to happen but nothing ever does, and then it just gets taken away anyway. it feels like i'm just going through the motions of a life that doesn't even belong to me anymore. does it even matter if i'm here or not if this is just how it always ends?",
